s his  last chance for gaining the power  necessary to become a hashida his  personal special abilities include  incredible jaw strength and special  digestive organs that make this  demonization possible he is the only one  in all the demon slayer core currently  with this talent after consuming some of  the wood jutsu genya becomes capable of  ripping a tree out of the ground and  throwing it at an enemy tundra for his  part is shocked by this display of  strength when he witnesses it kenya is  also strong enough to rip off the arms  of hantengu's giant resentment clone  when it appears we see that there is a  drawback to genji's demon power-ups when  we realize that nezuko's flames will  burn him too because of his partial  demon flesh so he has to retreat from  hantengu's burning body so tantra and  nezuko take over tundra ends up slicing  the real body's head but the price seems  very high indeed when it appears like  nezuko will burn in the sun luckily  nezuko becomes the first demon who can  withstand the sun at this point and  turns out to be fine tundra nesco hug  and witnessing this even the usually  angry genya can't help but crack a smile  now let's fast forward to the hashida  training arc where genya and sunemi have  another conversation like before senemy  tells genya that he doesn't have a  little brother and genyo should give up  he even says that if kenya doesn't knock  it off and quit playing at demon slayer  he'll straight up kill him he keeps  insulting him saying that someone who  can't even use breathing shouldn't call  himself a swordsman genya tries to  finally apologize but sademi says he  doesn't even care genya tries to defend  himself by saying he fought so hard and  even ate a demon but this only angers  sunami it appears like sanemy is about  to poke kenya's eyes out before tangero  rescues him tundra is angry that sanmi  just tried to kill his little brother  but sanemy says he'll just damage genya  beyond recovery unless he quests the  demonstrator core right away tundra  continues being the nice guy and points  out that if not for genya they would  have been defeated by the upper ranked  demon meaning hantengu as tundra spars  with an angry sun zenitsu helps get  genya out of there while remarking how  his older brother is crazy instead of  being grateful and understanding genya  punches zanitsu in the face saying don't  insult my big brother and all i can  think is oh man poor's 72 trying to do  someone a favor and getting punched in  the face now let's fast forward to  genya's most important fight the fight  against upper moon 1 kokushibo the  strongest upper moon kokushibo is a  whole other level of demon he's the  strongest demon after muzon and he was  originally a skilled demon slayer who  used arguably the second strongest form  of breathing after sun breathing namely  moon breathing his demonization  increased his powers and his moon  breathing was enhanced through his blood  demon art he's so strong that muichiro  one of the most talented hashira who  beat an upper moon by himself starts  shaking and senses that his body doesn't  want to fight for the first time in his  life after he takes out his blade and  uses moon breathing kokushibo  effortlessly cuts off muichiro's arm and  immobilizes him by pinning him to a beam  keep in mind he does this easily against  one of the most talented hashira who has  awakened his demon slayer mark which is  like going super saiyan for demon  slayers it is at this point that genya  appears in a matter of seconds kokoshibo  cuts off kenya's arms and then cuts his  body in two bisecting him kokoshibo can  tell immediately that genya is the one  who has been eating demons and even  mentions that over 300 years ago there  was another demonstrator like him  however with that demon slayer cutting  him in half killed him but genya is  still not dead just as kokushibo is  preparing to finish him off by cutting  off his head big bro sun emi comes in  and res