milar to kokoshibo's he then recalls  the plan he and muichiro devised once  muichiro stops kokushibo kenya has to  shoot without hesitation now that the  time has come genya aims his gun which  is now surrounded by demon flesh and  kokoshibo looking eyes the implication  is that the gun and bullets might be  more accurate and more powerful now and  as he fires the demonized shotgun we see  that genya can now control his bullets  like living things despite the fact that  kukushibo deflected them they make their  way into his body then genya uses a  blood demon art where the bullets sprout  into trees engulfing and trapping  kokoshibo this could be a throwback to  upper moon 4's wood style jutsu which is  cool since it implies genjia can keep  and adapt blood demon arch from demons  he tasted long ago and combined  different blood demon arts together to  form unique attacks like this one  despite temporarily trapping kokoshibo  and sending him into a flashback  kokoshibo ends up sprouting blades from  all over his body the blades are  accompanied by air slashes that free him  from the roots and hurt the slayers  bisecting genya vertically this time  muichiro's blade turns red and sun  mangyome keep pressuring kokushibo so  kenya again though badly hurt sees this  as an opportunity to attack again  because there are still flesh bullets  inside kokushibo he makes another root  sprout from kokoshibo's body and  kokushibo realizes he can't use his  technique when he tries to the tree in  his back is sucking up his blood and  growing from it so as a result he's  probably lacking the blood necessary to  use his op blood demon art and his body  is also seizing up due to the intense  pain of muichiro's red blade the bullets  and red blade make it possible for gyome  to drop his nietrain spike ball on  kokoshibo's head then tsunemi comes in  to complete the four-member combo attack  and hits down on gyome's spiked ball  both weapons turn red like muichiro's  meaning they are 